[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0010","text":"哦，原来在这种地方啊，美琴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0020","text":"制作人……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0030","text":"刚才找你没找到\n在透气吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0040","text":"……嗯，差不多吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0050","text":"从这里望出去的景色……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0060","text":"感觉和从舞台上看到的景色，有点像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0070","text":"啊，确实能望到很远呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0080","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0090","text":"好想……快点站上舞台啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_02_0100","text":"────因为想感觉到，自己活着"}]
